# Assets

## a.js

```js
// lib.cjs
module.exports = {
	value: 42,
	default: "named default"
};
Object.defineProperty(module.exports, "__proto__", {
	value: "own proto",
	enumerable: true
});

```

## b.js

```js
module.exports = require("./a.js");

```

## callable_a.js

```js
// callable.cjs
module.exports = function(value) {
	return value + 1;
};

```

